[{"client_msg_id":"09e89807-d274-43c6-b31f-a32da573c400","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちゃんと噛み合せがよければ、奥歯の1つですからね(形状の問題はあるけど)\n自分も1つだけの親不知、綺麗にはやしてたりします。","ts":"1633523356.477800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t75"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b188d1b-df25-4122-82ad-b6fa3e9511fa","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"えぇ…","ts":"1633520182.476600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S2wW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fd04212-9ba2-4655-be66-3bd1a19f202c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"虫歯になった時点で親知らずならすぐ抜くだろうという先入観が家族全員にあって、本人も延命してた理由を知らなかったので歯医者に行くまでは軽く口論になったりしてました","ts":"1633519596.476300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YZAyO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07a7e746-5cf1-489c-aa23-359e6d4cb014","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"親知らずといえば、父親の親知らずがこの前欠けたんですが、どうやらその親知らずは噛み合わせが非常によくて重要な歯だったらしい\n昔に虫歯をやらかしてたらしく、その時も神経抜いてまで延命してたらしいので相当重要なんだろうなという話\nなので今回も詰め物で延命するそうです","ts":"1633519454.473600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"kowawa","count":1,"users":["U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FlU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"187e34b6-cdb3-4572-ac17-c7271e467e78","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"いやー、こういうのは若いうちにさっさと受けとくのがいいだろなと思ったとおりですわ。来年には親知らずもやっつけたい。","ts":"1633519289.471700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h2w++"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7c74839-c7be-4f08-a2ec-45f698787c7b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だねえ","ts":"1633519255.470600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i3ym"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46605d70-376f-4195-ae73-516221f67c58","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"親知らず一本抜いただけで精神的に死にかけてた身からするとなかなか恐ろしい","ts":"1633519145.469800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gn4Aj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"185a87f0-f806-4f84-8f15-8ec2bfdb74e9","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"この手の手術は大変そう","ts":"1633519088.468600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"doA6R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4023F8A0-1FC2-475F-9296-6FA8CF7E0874","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ひぇ〜、大変そう","ts":"1633519083.468300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"773f61bc-2926-417e-8c64-e5258811b7ed","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"なにかあればまたツィッターのスレに繋いで、退院したらnoteにまとめよう。","ts":"1633518978.467500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"199b900a-db34-4f24-b443-703828f68739","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"鼻中隔湾曲症の手術で全身麻酔から生還。術後はそれなりに大変な模様……。\n\u003chttps://mobile.twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1445703793136394253|https://mobile.twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1445703793136394253\u003e\nfyi \u003c@UFHQ7TNT0\u003e","ts":"1633518940.466200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Atsushi776|@Atsushi776\u003e: 鼻中隔の術後、尿意を感じたところで起床。口中の血を洗う。食欲僅か。食べ始めたら熱が36.1-\u0026gt;36.7に。頭痛とだるさ。半分食べて軽く横になってから続き。するとゲップを催し直後嘔吐。術中か後かに胃に血が溜まっていた模様。","id":1,"author_name":"atusy","author_subname":"@Atsushi776","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1445703793136394253","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/737129240/P7502_normal.jpg","text":"鼻中隔の術後、尿意を感じたところで起床。口中の血を洗う。食欲僅か。食べ始めたら熱が36.1-\u0026gt;36.7に。頭痛とだるさ。半分食べて軽く横になってから続き。するとゲップを催し直後嘔吐。術中か後かに胃に血が溜まっていた模様。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1633517618,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://mobile.twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1445703793136394253","original_url":"https://mobile.twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1445703793136394253"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"pray","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"odaijini","count":8,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U01D44KSY9Z","U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V","U72TB62UF","U017BU3UZBQ","UL6CFN8NR","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TjD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70aae4d7-25a4-44c6-85c3-c6e33a1cb2f0","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"紅葉が見晴らせる場所に出た時は感嘆の声が出ました。","ts":"1633515201.464200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dT4L/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dba9d33-c8b3-4d80-8f45-7dae794aa965","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"めちゃくちゃ最高じゃないですか","ts":"1633514179.463700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iduWc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d96b326-432b-4d64-889a-87a05ee34469","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"おー","ts":"1633503959.462400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h8/m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3f0359d-8e98-447b-8c62-a5cb85b2ac8b","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"山に登ってきました。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/h0k0r0bi/status/1445206345402052616\u003e\n自分の足の筋力をわきまえて山頂には至らない計画を立てていましたが、つい魔がさして山頂にまで行ってしまい、案の定、下山時に膝の痛みで地獄を見ました。\n余計に時間もかかったので下山していないのに日没になった図。\n天候、景色は最高でした。","ts":"1633503800.461800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/h0k0r0bi|@h0k0r0bi\u003e: いい天気 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FA5nZxwVIAAMePc.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"hokorobi","author_subname":"@h0k0r0bi","author_link":"https://twitter.com/h0k0r0bi/status/1445206345402052616","aut